      "updated_at": "2026-04-07T08:32:30Z",
      "body": "I guess there are more libs that just ignore the hole in time.\nactually luxon already does some magic around this in https://github.com/moment/luxon/blob/651127dc694329d51b56d491c56408e9dc4e6923/src/datetime.js#L127, so my suggestion would simply be to mark the DateTime instance as invalid in exactly that case instead of silently messing around with the times that simply can't exist.",
